   "en": "«GEMARA:» With regard to that which was stated in the mishna, the Gemara asks: «What is» the tanna «saying» with regard to the distinction between brine and salt water? «Rav Yehuda said» that «Shmuel said: This is what he is saying: One may not prepare a large quantity of salt water,» brine, «on Shabbat, but one may prepare a small quantity of salt water.»"
